  "origin": "Eight are Blizzard's own icons made sharper, two are ours. Blizzard's (sources/micromenu/blizzard-<name>.png, cut from the client's micro menu atlases on black) were upscaled 16 times on ComfyUI by Real-ESRGAN x4plus_anime_6B (set micromenu-upscale); the talents icon, too small for that, was upscaled once and redrawn by FLUX.1 [schnell] at strength 0.55, seed 1 (set micromenu-talents, strength-55). The quest log and game menu icons are FLUX.1 [schnell] pictures of ours (set micromenu-01: painted-quests seed 53, painted-help seed 102). Each was then keyed off its black ground and squared to 256 px into sources/micromenu/upscaled-<name>.png or source-<name>.png; that keying is recorded nowhere (art/key.py with its defaults at 256 px does not make these files), so the steps start from those pictures. The step from them to the icons was wow-dev-tools design/scripts/micro-icons.py (58b8c36), which `fit` makes pixel for pixel. The design site draws these files (its sync converts them to PNG).",
